open_obligations.what_is_open:
The unresolved step is to construct, for every known sequential policy and before assignment, a member of the common-null family for which
\[
 \inf_{\widehat\theta}
 \mathbb E_{Q_{\pi,L},\pi}
 \left[(\widehat\theta-\theta_T(Y))^2\right]
 \ge
 \frac{\kappa_\beta}{\log(\mathrm eL)}
 \min\left\{\frac{B^2L}{T},\ B^2\wedge C^2L^{-2\beta}\right\}.
\]
A proof would give the requested policy-uniform logarithmic certificate; removing \(1/\log(\mathrm eL)\) would remain a separate refinement.
